693	     * For the naming convention of function suffixes:
694	     * <ul>
695	     *    <li>-LOSP:    Locked with any Of global am Service or Process lock</li>
696	     *    <li>-LSP:     Locked with both of global am Service and Process lock</li>
697	     *    <li>-Locked:  Locked with global am service lock alone</li>
698	     *    <li>-LPr:     Locked with Process lock alone</li>
