701	     * the above suffixes even if they're guarded by the locks here.
702	     * </p>
703	     *
704	     * <p>
705	     * In terms of locking order, it should be right below to the {@link #mGlobalLock},
706	     * and above everything else which used to be underneath the {@link #mGlobalLock}.
707	     * As of today, the core components(services/providers/broadcasts) are still guarded by
708	     * the {@link #mGlobalLock} alone, so be cautious, avoid from acquiring the {@link #mGlobalLock}
709	     * while holding this lock.
